OL,3,GNEWSACows back in field after moo-ving
OL,4,Aon to rail line
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services were temporarily held up
OL,7,Fafter several cows broke through
OL,8,Ffencing and moo-ved on to a railway
OL,9,Fline in Leicestershire.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for Network Rail said it
OL,12,Fwas reported at about 15:30 GMT on
OL,13,FMonday that several cows were on the
OL,14,Fline at East Langton, in the Harborough
OL,15,Fdistrict.
OL,17,FThe cows were safely returned to their
OL,18,Ffield just after 16:00, the
OL,19,Fspokesperson added.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
